 "intro": "Al-Isra Quran ki satrahvi Surah hai (111 ayat). Tafheem (Maududi) ke mutabiq iski pehli ayah se zahir hai ke yeh Mi‘raj ke mauqe par utri, jo Hijrat se kareeb ek saal pehle hua, isliye yeh Makkah ke aakhri daur ki Surah hai. Us waqt Nabi ﷺ barah saal se Tawhid ki dawat de rahe the, Aus aur Khazraj ke bahut se log Islam la chuke the aur Madinah ki taraf Hijrat ka waqt qareeb tha. Surah warning, naseehat aur taleem ka khoobsoorat majmua hai: Makkah ke mushrikin ko Bani Israel ke anjaam se sabaq diya gaya, Israelites ko khabardar kiya gaya, Tawhid, Akhirat aur Nabuwwat ke dalail diye gaye, aur akhlaq aur tehzeeb ke bunyadi usool bayan kiye gaye (Tafheem ke alfaaz mein ek tarah ka ‘manifesto’ jo Islami riyasat ke qayam se ek saal pehle ailaan hua). Nabi ﷺ ko kufr se samjhauta na karne aur sabit qadam rehne ki hidayat di gayi, aur Musalmanon ko sabr aur namaz ki taleem, kyunke Tafheem ke mutabiq Mi‘raj hi woh mauqa tha jab paanch waqt ki namazein pehli baar farz hui.",
