 "partsNote": "Parts ki hadein Tafsir Ibn Kathir ke tafsir-entries par hain (63 entries), koi ayat chhooti ya doharayi nahi gayi (111 mein se 111 ayat). Bade 12 groups ki hadein Surah ki 12 sections / rukū‘ (10, 22, 30, 40, 52, 60, 70, 77, 84, 93, 100, 111) par hain: yeh list islamicstudies.info ke Ma‘ariful Quran page ke ‘Verses [Section]’ header se li gayi, Tafheem ke page ke snippet se sirf aakhri section (101–111, 12/12) confirm hua, aur amrayn.com ki rukū‘ ki hadein bilkul inhi ke saath milti hain. Saari 12 section-hadein Ibn Kathir ki entries ke saath mil gayin, koi adjust nahi karna pada. Tafheem (Maududi) ka Surah-intro (Name, Period of Revelation, Background, Theme and Topics) amrayn.com par padha gaya; usme ayat-wise hadein nahi hain. Ma‘ariful Quran ka Surah 17 ka tafseeri matn nahi padha gaya, sirf section-list dekhi gayi, isliye uske hawale se koi tafseeri claim nahi kiya gaya. Hadith ke number sirf unhi ke diye gaye hain jo dekhe gaye; baaqi ke saath Ibn Kathir ka hawala hai.",
