   "intro": "Tafheem (Maududi) ke mutabiq is Surah ki pehli ayah se hi zahir hai ke yeh Mi‘raj ke mauqe par utri; riwayaton ke mutabiq yeh waqia Hijrat se kareeb ek saal pehle hua. Isliye yeh Makkah ke aakhri daur ki Surah hai. Ibn Kathir ne is ayah ke tahat Isra aur Mi‘raj ki riwayaton ka bahut bada zakheera jama kiya hai (entry kareeb 37,000 characters ki hai), aur Surah ke shuru mein Ibn Mas‘ud ka Bukhari wala qaul bhi likha ke Bani Isra‘il, Al-Kahf aur Maryam pehli aur khoobsoorat Surahon mein se hain aur ‘mera khazana’ hain.",
