   "intro": "Is Part ki shuruat sabse bade hukm Tawhid se hoti hai aur uske foran baad walidain ke haq ka bayan hai. Tafheem ke mutabiq Surah mein akhlaq aur tehzeeb ke woh bunyadi usool bayan hue hain jin par Islami nizaam-e-zindagi qaim hona tha (ek tarah ka ‘manifesto’); amrayn.com ke Introduction mein inhein ayah 22–39 ki ‘divine commandments’ kaha gaya hai.",
