     "t": "Ayah 45–46: jab tum Quran padhte ho to Hum tumhare aur Akhirat par imaan na rakhne walon ke beech ek chhupa hua parda daal dete hain; aur Hum un ke dilon par ghilaaf daal dete hain ke woh use samajh na saken aur unke kaanon mein bahraapan, aur jab tum Quran mein sirf apne Rabb ka zikr karte ho to woh nafrat se peeth pher kar bhaag jate hain. Ibn Kathir (‘The Veil over the Hearts of the Idolators’): Allah Nabi ﷺ se kehta hai ke jab tum in mushrikin ko Quran sunate ho to Hum tumhare aur unke beech ek chhupa hua parda daal dete hain; Qatadah aur Ibn Zayd ne kaha ke yeh unke dilon par ghilaaf hain. Is entry ka baaqi hissa Story Mode mein poora nahi padha gaya."
