   "intro": "Is Part mein Iblis ki purani dushmani ka bayan hai: Adam ko sajde ka hukm, Iblis ka takabbur, uski mohlat ki darkhwast aur Allah ka jawab. amrayn.com ke Introduction ke mutabiq ayah 61–65 mein shaytan aur uske waswaso se khabardar kiya gaya hai.",
