     "h": "Adam ko sajda aur Iblis ka inkaar",
     "t": "Ayah 61–62: aur jab Humne farishton se kaha ‘Adam ko sajda karo’ to sab ne sajda kiya siwa Iblis ke; usne kaha ‘kya main use sajda karun jise tu ne mitti se banaya?’; usne kaha ‘zara bata, yeh jise tu ne mujh par izzat di, agar tu mujhe Qayamat tak mohlat de to main iski aulad ko apni giraft mein le loonga siwa thode se’. Ibn Kathir: yahan Iblis ki purani dushmani ka bayan hai jo Adam ke paida hone ke waqt se hai, jab Allah ne farishton ko sajde ka hukm diya aur sab ne sajda kiya siwa Iblis ke; usne takabbur se sawal kiya aur doosri ayah (7:12) mein kaha ‘main us se behtar hoon, tu ne mujhe aag se banaya aur use mitti se’. ‘Main iski aulad ko apni giraft mein loonga’ ke baare mein ‘Ali bin Abi Talhah (Ibn ‘Abbas ke zariye) ne ‘ghalib aa jaunga’, Mujahid ne ‘gher loonga’ aur Ibn Zayd ne ‘gumrah karunga’ kaha; Ibn Kathir ke mutabiq yeh sab ma‘na mein qareeb hain. Is entry ka koi alag sub-heading nahi."
