   "intro": "Surah ke is hisse mein namaz ka hukm aur uske waqt aate hain. Tafheem ke mutabiq namaz is liye farz hui ke musalmanon ki rooh ki islah aur paakeezgi ho, aur Tafheem ke mutabiq Mi‘raj hi woh mauqa tha jab paanch waqt ki namazein pehli baar muqarrar hui.",
